    "created_at": "2016-04-11T15:09:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-11T15:09:45Z",
    "body": "Does anyone actually use this attribute for anything?  Apart from the reflection bits, I don't see any UA conformance requirements for the `headers` attribute on table cells/headers.  Am I just missing them?\n\nIf there are no UA conformance requirements, why would anyone even set this attribute?\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
