    "created_at": "2016-04-11T15:10:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-11T15:10:52Z",
    "body": "Oh, and note that I don't object to trying to make this a tokenlist; I'm just trying to determine the likely compat risks and likely benefits.  Currently, my best guess is that the latter is zero and the former is pretty much zero...\n",
