    "created_at": "2016-04-11T15:15:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-11T15:15:15Z",
    "body": "`headers` is for a11y/semantics, at least in theory: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#table-descriptions-techniques\n\nI agree that the intersection of people who are using it for these purposes and people who really wish they could use the DOMTokenList interface to do so is probably zero, or in the single digits.\n\nping seems more likely to be useful and, modulo the compat risks, I think it'd be nice if that were implemented as a DOMTokenList.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
