    "created_at": "2016-04-11T15:21:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-11T15:21:30Z",
    "body": "Implementation burden for changing headers is close to zero, so if compat risk is also close to zero, I'm in favor of changing it for the sake of being nicer/more consistent/etc.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
