    "updated_at": "2016-05-13T23:46:25Z",
    "body": "OK, so with that new info I feel like we should probably change ping to a string, as sad as it is. Does anyone disagree?\n\nCan we get two implementers interested in adding `pingList`, or should we just give up on a structured DOM API for multiple ping URLs?\n",
